msgid ""
"%1 is already available on majority of Linux distributions. It can be "
"installed directly from [Discover](%2), [GNOME Software](%2) or your "
"distribution’s [software store](%2)."
msgstr ""
"%1 sudah tersedia dalam banyak distribusi Linux. Dapat diinstal langsung "
"dari [Discover](%2), [GNOME Software](%2) atau [toko perangkat lunak](%2) "
"distribusi Anda."

#. download.source.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:357
msgid "Release Sources"
msgstr "Sumber Rilis"

#. download.source.description
#. %1 app name
#: i18n/en.yaml:359
msgid ""
"%1 is released regularly as part of KDE Gear. You can find %1 latest stable "
"release among the [tarballs from the latest KDE Gear release](https://"
"download.kde.org/stable/release-service).\n"
"\n"
"If you want to build %1 from sources, we recommend checking our [Getting "
"Involved](/get-involved) page which contains links to full guide how to "
"compile %1.\n"
msgstr ""
"%1 dirilis secara reguler sebagai bagian dari KDE Gear. Anda dapat menemukan "
"rilis %1 stabil terkini dengan [tarball dari rilis KDE Gear terkini](https://"
"download.kde.org/stable/release-service).\n"
"\n"
"Jika Anda ingin membangun %1 dari sumber, kami menyarankan untuk memeriksa "
"laman [Getting Involved](/get-involved) yang berisi tautan ke panduan "
"lengkap cara mengompilasi %1.\n"

#. download.flatpak.description
#. %1 app name, %2 link, %3 link
#: i18n/en.yaml:367
msgid ""
"You can install the latest [%1 flatpak](%2) from Flathub. Experimental "
"flatpaks with nightly builds of %1 can be [installed from the KDE Flatpak "
"repository](%3)."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menginstal yang [flatpak %1](%2) terkini dari Flathub. Flatpak "
"eksperimental dengan bangunan nightly %1 dapat [diinstal dari repositori "
"Flatpak KDE](%3)."

#. download.install
#: i18n/en.yaml:370
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Penginstalan"

#. download.install.platform
#. %1 app name
#: i18n/en.yaml:372
msgid ""
"To install %1, follow the instructions of the platform you are using for how "
"to install software. Most platforms have a graphical installer which can be "
"used to install software packages. In many cases it will automatically be "
"opened when clicking the download or install link for your platform. There "
"is a [generic tutorial for installing KDE applications](https://userbase.kde."
"org/Tutorials/Install_KDE_software) which also can be applied to %1."
msgstr ""
"Untuk menginstal %1, ikuti instruksi platform yang Anda gunakan cara untuk "
"menginstal perangkat lunak. Kebanyakan platform memiliki penginstal grafik "
"yang dapat digunakan untuk menginstal paket perangkat lunak. Dalam beberapa "
"kasus itu dapat dibuka secara otomatis ketika mengklik tautan unduh atau "
"instal untuk platform Anda. Tersedia [tutorial generik untuk menginstal "
"aplikasi KDE](https://userbase.kde.org/Tutorials/Install_KDE_software) yang "
"dapat diterapkan untuk %1."

#. download.install.platform.components
#. %1 app name
#: i18n/en.yaml:375
msgid ""
"To install %1 or one of its components as a stand-alone application, follow "
"the instructions of the platform you are using for how to install software. "
"Most platforms have a graphical installer which can be used to install "
"software packages. In many cases it will automatically be opened when "
"clicking the download or install link for your platform. There is a [generic "
"tutorial for installing KDE applications](https://userbase.kde.org/Tutorials/"
"Install_KDE_software) which also can be applied to %1."
msgstr ""
"Untuk menginstal %1 atau salah satu komponennya sebagai aplikasi sendiri, "
"ikuti instruksi platform yang Anda gunakan cara untuk menginstal perangkat "
"lunak. Kebanyakan platform memiliki penginstal grafik yang dapat dibuka "
"secara otomatis ketika mengklik tautan unduh atau instal untuk platform "
"Anda. Tersedia [tutorial generik untuk menginstal aplikasi KDE](https://"
"userbase.kde.org/Tutorials/Install_KDE_software) yang dapat diterapkan untuk "
"%1."

#. download.install.linux
#. %1 app name
#: i18n/en.yaml:378
msgid ""
"If you are using Linux, %1 might already be pre-installed on your system as "
"part of a default selection. If not, you can install it with the package "
"management tool of your Linux distribution. See its documentation for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda menggunakan Linux, %1 mungkin sudah ada di sistem Anda sebagai "
"seleksi baku. Jika tidak, Anda dapat menginstalnya dengan alat pengelola "
"paket distribusi Linux Anda. Lihat dokumentasinya untuk rincian."

#. download.install.modular.components
#. %1 app name
#: i18n/en.yaml:381
msgid ""
"In many cases you will have the opportunity to install %1 in a modular way, "
"so you can decide to only install the set of components you actually want to "
"use. Translations of the user interface often also will be available as "
"separate module you can install according to your needs and preferences."
msgstr ""
"Dalam banyak kasus Anda akan memiliki kesempatan untuk menginstal %1 dengan "
"cara modular, sehingga Anda dapat memutuskan untuk hanya menginstal set "
"komponen yang benar-benar ingin Anda gunakan. Terjemahan antarmuka pengguna "
"seringkali juga akan tersedia sebagai modul terpisah yang dapat Anda instal "
"sesuai dengan kebutuhan dan preferensi Anda."

#. download.uninstall
#: i18n/en.yaml:384
msgid "Uninstallation"
msgstr "Copot Pemasangan"

#. download.uninstall.instruction
#. %1 app name
#: i18n/en.yaml:386
msgid ""
"To uninstall %1, follow the instructions of the package management tool you "
"have used to install %1. This will remove the %1 application. It will not "
"touch data you have viewed, created, or modified with %1."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mencopot pemasangan %1, ikuti instruksi alat pengelola paket Anda "
"gunakan untuk menginstal %1. Ini akan menghapus aplikasi %1. Data Anda yang "
"Anda lihat, buat, atau dimodifikasi dengan %1 tidak akan disentuh."

#. download.uninstall.instruction.components
#. %1 app name
#: i18n/en.yaml:389
msgid ""
"To uninstall %1, follow the instructions of the package management tool you "
"have used to install %1 and its components. This will remove the components "
"of your choice. It will not touch data you have viewed, created, or modified "
"with %1."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mencopot pemasangan %1, ikuti instruksi alat pengelola paket Anda "
"gunakan untuk menginstal %1 dan komponennya. Ini akan menghapus komponen "
"yang Anda pilih. Data Anda yang Anda lihat, buat, atau dimodifikasi dengan "
"%1 tidak akan disentuh."

#. download.packaging_status
#: i18n/en.yaml:392
msgid "Packaging status"
msgstr "Status pemaketan"

#. download.nightly
