#. users.handbook.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:397
msgid "Handbook"
msgstr "Handbook"

#. users.handbook.description
#. %1 app name, %2 link
#: i18n/en.yaml:399
msgid ""
"Lost in %1 settings or just looking to discover more features in %1? You can "
"read the [%1 Handbook](%2) to find answers to your questions."
msgstr ""
"Tersesat dalam pengaturan %1 atau hanya ingin menemukan lebih banyak fitur "
"di %1? Anda dapat membaca [Handbook %1](%2) untuk menemukan jawaban atas "
"pertanyaan Anda."

#. users.help.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:402
msgid "Need Help?"
msgstr "Butuh Bantuan?"

#. users.help.description
#. %1 app name, %2 link
#: i18n/en.yaml:404
msgid ""
"Check %1 on [KDE Forum](%2), maybe someone has already solved a similar "
"problem. And if not, feel free to ask there!"
msgstr ""
"Periksa %1 di [Forum KDE](%2), mungkin seseorang telah menyelesaikan sebuah "
"masalah yang terkait. Dan jika tidak, jangan sungkan untuk bertanya di sana!"

#. users.bug.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:407
msgid "Found a Bug?"
msgstr "Ketemu sebuah Kutu?"

#. users.bug.description
#. %1 app name
#: i18n/en.yaml:409
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Bugs in software happen. If you found some in %1, please report them into "
#| "[our Bugzilla](https://bugs.kde.org). Please do not report bugs on forums "
#| "or mailing lists - such reports will most likely be overlooked or "
#| "forgotten by the developers quite soon. To make sure the bug gets noticed "
#| "by developers and fixed as soon as possible, report it into Bugzilla."
msgid ""
"Bugs in software happen. If you found some in %1, please report them into "
"[our Bugzilla](https://bugs.kde.org). Please do not report bugs on forums or "
"mailing lists — such reports will most likely be overlooked or forgotten by "
"the developers quite soon. To make sure the bug gets noticed by developers "
"and fixed as soon as possible, report it into Bugzilla."
msgstr ""
"Kutu dalam perangkat lunak dapat terjadi. Jika Anda menemukan beberapa di "
"%1, laporkan ke [Bugzilla kami](https://bugs.kde.org). Mohon jangan laporkan "
"kutu di forum atau milis - laporan seperti itu kemungkinan besar akan "
"diabaikan atau dilupakan oleh pengembang. Untuk memastikan kutu diperhatikan "
"oleh pengembang dan diperbaiki sesegera mungkin, laporkan ke Bugzilla."

#. users.feature.title
#: i18n/en.yaml:412
msgid "Missing a Feature?"
msgstr "Kehilangan sebuah Fitur?"

#. users.feature.description
#. %1 app name
#: i18n/en.yaml:414
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "%1 has a lot of features, but there's always a room for one or two more. "
#| "If you have an idea for an improvement or you are missing a feature in "
#| "%1, write your suggestion in our [Bugzilla](https://bugs.kde.org) so that "
#| "the developers can find it and implement it."
msgid ""
"%1 has a lot of features, but there’s always a room for one or two more. If "
"you have an idea for an improvement or you are missing a feature in %1, "
"write your suggestion in our [Bugzilla](https://bugs.kde.org) so that the "
"developers can find it and implement it."
msgstr ""
"%1 memiliki banyak fitur, tetapi selalu ada ruang untuk satu atau dua fitur "
"lagi. Jika Anda memiliki ide untuk peningkatan atau Anda kehilangan fitur di "
"%1, tuliskan saran Anda di [Bugzilla](https://bugs.kde.org) kami sehingga "
"pengembang dapat menemukannya dan menerapkannya."

