#~ "mailing list](https://mail.kde.org/mailman/listinfo/kde-frameworks-"
#~ "devel). Policies and the current state of the project and plans are "
#~ "available at the [Frameworks wiki](https://community.kde.org/Frameworks). "
#~ "Real-time discussions take place on the [#kde-devel IRC channel on Libera "
#~ "Chat](irc://irc.libera.chat/#kde-devel)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Mereka yang tertarik untuk mengikuti dan berkontribusi pada pengembangan "
#~ "Kerangka Kerja dapat melihat [repositori git](https://invent.kde.org/"
